# SeatSwap — all agents, all models: read agents.md, then docs/01–14 in order.
designs/*.jpg is visual reference (agents.md wins on conflict).
MANDATORY: docs/13-COLLAB-CONTRACT.md — claim ONE lane in docs/14-LANES.md
before editing; touch only that lane's files; a cross-lane need becomes a
`request:` line, never an edit. Session start: git pull --rebase, git status
--short, hot-file check. Green rule: typecheck + test + build before commit.
Only student/startup-credit or free products; never add a paid dependency,
SMS or paid OTP. Never git add -A.
